Transportation systems offer additional demand through integrated fare-payment platforms and contactless ticketing infrastructure.

Healthcare and enterprise access control also create opportunities for secure authentication products.

The expansion of multi-application credentials and improved chip security could further strengthen the position of smart cards within digital service infrastructure.

